{"id":"8b6134451906e575","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-relative-smn.md","title":"相对参数定理的 oracle 统一性","display":"thm-relative-smn — 相对参数定理的 oracle 统一性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-relative-smn","aliases":["20-thm-relative-smn"],"display":"thm-relative-smn — 相对参数定理的 oracle 统一性","chapter":"3","section":"3.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 3.3.12","source_pdf_pages":[94],"source_printed_pages":[58],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-lem-padding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-relative-smn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-relative-smn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-smn — 相对参数定理的 oracle 统一性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.3.12"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>94</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\ge1\">\\(m,n\\ge1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}smn}\\vdash\n\\exists s\\in\\mathcal C_{m+1}^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e,j\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in\\omega^m\\\n[s(e,\\vec a)=s(j,\\vec b)\\Rightarrow(e=j\\land\\vec a=\\vec b)],\\\\\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\omega^m\\ \\forall\\vec y\\in\\omega^n\\\n[\\Phi_{s(e,\\vec a)}^A(\\vec y)\\simeq\\Phi_e^A(\\vec a,\\vec y)]\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}smn}\\vdash\n\\exists s\\in\\mathcal C_{m+1}^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e,j\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in\\omega^m\\\n[s(e,\\vec a)=s(j,\\vec b)\\Rightarrow(e=j\\land\\vec a=\\vec b)],\\\\\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\omega^m\\ \\forall\\vec y\\in\\omega^n\\\n[\\Phi_{s(e,\\vec a)}^A(\\vec y)\\simeq\\Phi_e^A(\\vec a,\\vec y)]\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\omega^m\">\\(\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec a\\in\\omega^m\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega,\\vec a\\in\\omega^m\">\\(e\\in\\omega,\\vec a\\in\\omega^m\\)</span>。编译器仅写入有限参数与原程序编号，保留所有 oracle 指令，因此同一个普通全可计算编译器适用于每个 oracle。向有限程序追加不可能到达的状态及转移行，可把不同的参数元组写入程序的无效区；有效解码及取足够大的新状态使整个元组到程序码的映射单射。新增状态不被原转移指向，故对所有 oracle 均不改变行为。这是原书 Theorem 3.3.12 要求的一一性质，供跳跃定理的一一归约复用。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.3.12；印刷页 58；PDF 第 94 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":